    <section anchor="validity">
      <name>Validity</name>
      <t anchor="R-VALID">For a text of odd length, miniIsValid <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> return false, but not for the empty text.</t>
      <sourcecode type="ts-property"><![CDATA[
